    "sub_ename": "FINANCIAL DATA ANALYSIS AND APPLICATION",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在協助學生瞭解金融數據擷取與分析，利用python程式編碼與統計方法於金融資料分析，並應用機器學習進行違約模型建構。",
    "describe_eh": "The course aims at helping students to be able to understand financial data scraping and analysis. We combine both python coding and statistical concepts and apply those methods to analyze financial data, which supplemented with credit default model construct by machine learning",
